    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d58">

                <pb facs="0116" n="56" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg56"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Bancroft.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 83.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 14, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have just received your dispatch of the
                    25th of August, which is accompanied by the circular letters of the minister of
                    justice and minister of the interior. These papers will be immediately
                    promulgated, and will have a very benign effect.</p>
                <p>Please assure the government of the North German Union that the President highly
                    appreciates these new manifestations of good will and friendship on the part of
                    the North German Union.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">George Bancroft,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
